direction: right

*.style.border-radius: 8
*.style.font-size: 13
*.style.fill: "#f5f5f5"
*.style.stroke: "#333333"

# --- Entry ---

entry: |md
  **Forked review sub-agent**
  test engineer

  - context: fork, model opus
  - question: can this be validated?
  - allowed-tools: Read, Grep, Glob
  - no Write (assessment returned)
| {
  shape: rectangle
  style.fill: "#f5f5f5"
  style.stroke: "#333333"
  style.stroke-width: 2
}

# --- Inputs ---

inputs: |md
  **Read Inputs**

  - artifacts/strat-tasks/
    (refined strategy features)
  - x-ref artifacts/rfe-tasks/
    (original acceptance criteria)
| {
  shape: rectangle
  style.fill: "#f5f5f5"
  style.stroke: "#333333"
  style.stroke-width: 2
}

# --- Re-review gate ---

rereview: |md
  **Re-review?**

  - artifacts/strat-reviews/
    has files for these?
| {
  shape: diamond
  style.fill: "#f5f5f5"
  style.stroke: "#333333"
  style.stroke-width: 2
}

rereview-compare: |md
  **Compare vs prior review**

  - concerns addressed?
  - concerns remaining?
  - new issues introduced?
| {
  shape: rectangle
  style.fill: "#f5f5f5"
  style.stroke: "#333333"
  style.stroke-width: 2
}

# --- Assess (LLM sub-agent, double border) ---

assess: Assess (5 dimensions) {
  style.fill: "#e8e8e8"
  style.stroke: "#333333"
  style.stroke-width: 3
  style.double-border: true

  dim1: |md
    **1 Acceptance testable**

    - concrete test per criterion
    - 'users can do X' = testable
    - 'system is reliable' = not
  | {
    shape: rectangle
    style.fill: "#f5f5f5"
    style.stroke: "#333333"
    style.stroke-width: 2
  }

  dim2: |md
    **2 Success measurable**

    - '>80% reduction' has baseline?
    - metric + target defined?
  | {
    shape: rectangle
    style.fill: "#f5f5f5"
    style.stroke: "#333333"
    style.stroke-width: 2
  }

  dim3: |md
    **3 Missing edge cases**

    - failure modes, boundaries
    - concurrent access, large-scale
    - backwards-compat w/ deployments
  | {
    shape: rectangle
    style.fill: "#f5f5f5"
    style.stroke: "#333333"
    style.stroke-width: 2
  }

  dim4: |md
    **4 Test strategy**

    - unit / integration / e2e
    - hard-to-test: external deps,
      multi-cluster scenarios
  | {
    shape: rectangle
    style.fill: "#f5f5f5"
    style.stroke: "#333333"
    style.stroke-width: 2
  }

  dim5: |md
    **5 Non-functional testable**

    - performance benchmarks
    - scalability limits, security
  | {
    shape: rectangle
    style.fill: "#f5f5f5"
    style.stroke: "#333333"
    style.stroke-width: 2
  }
}

# --- Output ---

test-out: |md
  **Testability assessment**
  returned to orchestrator

  - per-strategy structured block
  - concrete rewrites for
    vague / untestable criteria
| {
  shape: rectangle
  style.fill: "#f5f5f5"
  style.stroke: "#333333"
  style.stroke-width: 2
}

# --- Callout: per-strategy output block ---

assessment-block: |md
  ### STRAT-NNN: {title}
  Testability: {testable / partially / untestable}
  Missing edge cases: {list or none}
  Untestable criteria: {list or none}
  Test complexity: {straightforward / moderate / infra}
  Recommendation: {approve / revise criteria / add plan}
| {
  shape: rectangle
  style.fill: "#f5f5f5"
  style.stroke: "#bbbbbb"
  style.stroke-width: 1
  style.font: mono
  style.font-size: 10
}

# --- Flow ---

entry -> inputs
inputs -> rereview: "strat-tasks/*.md"
inputs -> assess: "rfe-tasks/*.md acceptance criteria"

rereview -> rereview-compare: "re-review"
rereview -> assess: "first review"
rereview-compare -> assess

assess -> test-out

test-out -> assessment-block: {
  style.stroke: "#bbbbbb"
  style.stroke-dash: 4
  style.stroke-width: 1
}
